        "jsCode": "const item = $input.item;\n\n// Get THIS receipt's attachment metadata from Split Receipts\nconst attachment =\n  $('Split Receipts').item.json['body.chat.messagePayload.message.attachment'];\n\n// Keep the downloaded bytes unchanged.\n// Correct n8n's file metadata for this specific receipt.\nitem.binary.data.fileName = attachment.contentName;\nitem.binary.data.mimeType = attachment.contentType;\n\n// Unique ID for matching this receipt later\nitem.json.receipt_id = attachment.name;\n\nreturn item;"
