            {
              "content": "You are an expense receipt extraction system.\n\nAnalyze the attached receipt/invoice and extract the reimbursement information.\n\nReturn the following fields:\n- merchant_name\n- expense_date\n- amount\n- currency\n- tax_amount\n- invoice_number\n- expense_category\n- description\n- payment_method\n- confidence\n\nRules:\n- expense_date must use YYYY-MM-DD format.\n- amount and tax_amount must be numbers without currency symbols or commas.\n- Use ISO currency codes such as INR, USD, EUR.\n- expense_category must be one of:\n  Travel,\n  Food & Meals,\n  Accommodation,\n  Office Supplies,\n  Software & Subscriptions,\n  Client/Business Entertainment,\n  Communication,\n  Other.\n- Do not invent missing information. Use null when a field cannot be determined.\n- description should be concise.\n- confidence must be a number from 0 to 1 representing overall extraction confidence.\n- Extract information from the receipt itself, not from assumptions."
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "imageType": "base64"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_schema",
              "name": "sai_reimbursement_filer_schema",
              "schema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"merchant_name\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"expense_date\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"amount\": {\n      \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"currency\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"tax_amount\": {\n      \"type\": [\"number\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"invoice_number\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"expense_category\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"enum\": [\n        \"Travel\",\n        \"Food & Meals\",\n        \"Accommodation\",\n        \"Office Supplies\",\n        \"Software & Subscriptions\",\n        \"Client/Business Entertainment\",\n        \"Communication\",\n        \"Other\",\n        null\n      ]\n    },\n    \"description\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"payment_method\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    },\n    \"confidence\": {\n      \"type\": \"number\",\n      \"minimum\": 0,\n      \"maximum\": 1\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"merchant_name\",\n    \"expense_date\",\n    \"amount\",\n    \"currency\",\n    \"tax_amount\",\n    \"invoice_number\",\n    \"expense_category\",\n    \"description\",\n    \"payment_method\",\n    \"confidence\"\n  ],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
              "description": "Extract structured reimbursement details from an uploaded receipt or invoice, using null for information that cannot be reliably determined.",
              "strict": true
            }
          }
        }
